owo_binop: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_binop: operands def:a def:b; minted a b
owo_binop: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_binop: two scopes, the first operand's minted first: true
owo_ternop: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_ternop: operands def:a def:b def:c; minted a b c
owo_ternop: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_ternop: three scopes, minted left to right: true
owo_where: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_where: operands def:cond def:a def:b; minted cond a b
owo_where: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_where: three scopes, condition then arms left to right: true
owo_if: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_if: operands def:a def:b; minted a b
owo_if: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_if: two scopes, condition before body: true
owo_cse: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_cse: operands def:a read:a; minted a
owo_cse: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_cse: the second operand reads the scope the first defines: true
owo_cse_between: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_cse_between: operands def:a def:b read:a; minted a b
owo_cse_between: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_cse_between: the first copy survives, read by the last; the middle operand is minted after it: true
owo_instantiate_binop: nested loop bindings are freshened left to right: true
owo_instantiate_ternop: nested loop bindings are freshened left to right: true
